WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
A transfer moves energy; a transformation changes its type.

2
00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:08.376
A torch. The battery stores chemical energy.

3
00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:13.777
Chemical becomes electrical: the type changes. That's a transformation.

4
00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:18.778
Electrical becomes light in the bulb, with some heat as a by-product.

5
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.055
A transfer keeps the same type, just in a new place.
